<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - July 30.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - July 30.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk first week Aug 84.00/85.00 Oct/Dec 87.50</p>
<p>West Norfolk Sep 81.50/82.00 Oct/Dec 87.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire first week Aug 85.00</p>
<p>Liverpool first week Aug 87.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to East Anglia asa 73.50/74.00/75.00</p>
</text>
